WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.334
The Energy Department says it

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.069
now believes a lab leak in

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.270
China is most likely

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.473
the cause of the COVID 19 pandemic.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:06.973
Now, before

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.242
now, the department said it was undecided

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.710
on how the virus emerged.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.512
It cites updated intelligence

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.747
for this new assessment.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:14.581
Now a caveat.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:15.215
Sources tell

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.516
CNN the Energy Department

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.151
has just low confidence

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.319
in these findings.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.354
China, predictably, is furious

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.156
and pushing back.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.624
David Culver joins us now.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:25.225
So, David,

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:26.659
you were in Wuhan

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:28.461
in China in January of 2020

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.763
where the first COVID cases

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:30.597
were detected.

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:31.664
There was a theory back

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.600
then that the virus had emerged

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.869
at a massive food market there

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.670
and then travel to animals.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.104
Tell us

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.639
about how China is now

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.242
responding, though, to this new report.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.143
You hit it, Brianna,

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:43.777
when you said that

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.345
they're not happy with it.

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:46.413
This infuriates them.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.448
This is one of the most sensitive issues

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:49.849
for the Chinese government.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.151
And it's been so sensitive

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.185
going back to, say,

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.553
April 20, 20 a few months

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.255
after the initial outbreak

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.256
that they launched

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.591
this relentless propaganda campaign

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.226
to try to counter the narrative,

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.395
to try to sow doubt and deflect blame.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.563
And it seems to have been

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.598
mostly successful within China

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.600
and that it's muddied the waters there.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.568
But their reaction

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.469
a few hours ago

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.003
from the foreign

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.505
ministry is one of the

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:13.873
we've really, quite frankly, seen

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:14.741
many times before,

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:15.308
and that is

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.076
they're telling the US

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.544
to stop smearing China

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.746
and to stop politicizing the issue.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.815
Also worth noting in that response

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.850
from the foreign ministry today,

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.919
they point out the W.H.O.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:26.686
conclusion

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:29.222
after their field visit in 2021

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.957
and they say that the W.H.O.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:31.991
field team determined

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.094
that it was highly unlikely

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:34.861
that a lab leak

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.963
was the origin of COVID 19.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:37.664
That is true.

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:38.264
The W.H.O.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:38.731
field team

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:42.001
did say that and in their conclusion

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.770
to that field visit

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.505
the issue is the unknown Victor.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.741
That also went on to ask for a second

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.343
follow up field visit.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.511
And the Chinese

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.979
said, no, that's not going to happen.

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:54.414
They did not let that team

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.382
back into Wuhan, China.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:57.217
And we're hearing

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:58.651
from some of those scientists

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.452
who are part of that.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.420
And they told me early

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.421
on that

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:02.255
they had asked for data

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.057
from some of the Chinese officials

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:04.891
who were on the ground

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:06.126
and that data was never handed

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:06.693
over to them.

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:08.194
Would

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.496
cover thank you for

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.264
the reporting and stay with us here.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.032
CNN national security analyst Juliette

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.934
Kayyem is joining the conversation.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.469
She's the former assistant secretary

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.171
of the Department of Homeland Security.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.172
Juliette,

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.441
how much credence should people give

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.177
a most likely report

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:25.578
from the Energy Department

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:28.748
in which they only have low confidence

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.783
Right. Not much.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.019
And I'll just be clear here.

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:34.687
You have to look at the totality

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:35.622
of the intelligence

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:37.023
community's assessment.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.025
So it may be confusing

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.627
to people who haven't been in this world.

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.595
I've been a consumer of intelligence

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:45.231
my entire career. So you have four.

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.132
So so

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.001
what happens when there's a question

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.435
like this is different

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.970
intelligence communities

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.072
assess what they know

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.641
and what they've determined.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:58.044
You are going to rely on the Expertize

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:59.112
of certain intelligence

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:00.246
agencies over another.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:01.047
So a perfect

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:03.349
example is a maritime threat.

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:03.650
You're going

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.518
to lean more heavily on the Coast Guard

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.654
than you would say on TSA.

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:09.189
On an aviation threat.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.223
So right now, here's

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:12.325
the scorecard, so to speak.

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:13.326
You have the Department of Energy

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:14.260
at low confidence,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.563
the FBI at medium confidence

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.632
for intelligence agencies.

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:20.433
More likely

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:24.704
than not on the natural release side

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.372
and an overall national

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.174
intelligence review

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.242
Also in the state,

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.344
most likely that it was natural.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:33.179
These are all caveated.

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:34.280
And so we don't know.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.548
I mean, the truth is we don't know.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:36.916
But the idea that

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:39.519
that in energy department switch

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.722
to low confidence is changes

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.590
that calculation

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.357
or should be used

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:45.258
politically is

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.560
just it's a misunderstanding.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.996
Of how the intelligence works.

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:50.863
So, Juliette,

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.799
how should we read these qualifiers then?

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:54.300
Because the FBI had deemed

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.202
this moderate confidence

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.937
that this began in a lab.

00:03:57.937 --> 00:03:59.405
And now we have this information

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:00.773
from the Department of Energy.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:01.774
Low confidence.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:03.576
Right.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.010
So.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.180
So these are all just levels of caveat.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.648
In because intelligence is

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:10.817
is something that has to be consumed

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:12.585
and then assessed by analysis.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.087
So here's where I start.

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:16.022
Not a single intelligence

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:18.458
community member nor the W.H.O.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.260
believes that it is purposeful

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.261
bioterrorism.

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:23.363
I want to make that clear

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:24.330
because it is

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.231
this report

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.400
is being manipulated to suggest

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.902
that China was purposeful.

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:32.071
All the lab leak theory

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:34.140
is also an accidental theory,

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.575
no matter who you ask.

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:35.942
It is

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.010
that someone

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.544
got infected in the lab

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.513
and then it starts to spread.

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:43.750
So between the lab leak and and

00:04:44.183 --> 00:04:46.486
and natural causes.

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:48.721
The second point is

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:50.657
we won't know because China,

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:54.494
of course, views this as as a threat

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:56.663
to whatever narrative they were,

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.364
the narrative that they want to put out.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:00.667
So we don't have full transparency.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.735
And so the question

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.137
now is, what do we do with this?

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:04.904
Why does this matter?

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:06.105
What matters obviously

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:07.240
because you're going to want labs

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.242
to be safer and

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:11.311
and to know what had happened.

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:12.879
Does it change?

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:14.180
Does it

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:14.781
change a

00:05:14.781 --> 00:05:17.083
narrative about how each individual

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.152
country responded? Probably not.

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:21.587
And the reason why we want to be careful

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:22.588
about how we interpret

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:23.623
this is because as we're

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:26.492
reporting, China's reaction does matter.

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:27.293
I mean, you know,

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:27.627
I mean,

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:29.529
if this was a lab leak,

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:31.831
it's very different to them

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.566
than if this was in, say,

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:35.768
a market or natural causes.

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.970
So but I'm

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:39.839
maybe I've been in this role too long.

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:41.941
I'm comfortable in the space of

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:43.609
we don't know yet,

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:43.910
but the

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.579
totality of the intelligence community

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.548
believes

00:05:48.548 --> 00:05:51.451
more likely that it was natural causes.

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:53.920
And all of the intelligence community

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.255
believes that it was not bioterrorism.

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:59.192
David, talk to us more about Guha.

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.393
And you've been there

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:02.495
three times since the initial outbreak.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:05.331
Talk to us about the research labs there.

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:08.167
There's more than one.

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:09.702
There are there

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:10.970
there are several and two

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:11.871
in particular, Victor,

00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:12.405
that have gotten

00:06:12.405 --> 00:06:13.439
the focus

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:15.007
of those who are skeptical

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:16.376
of how the Chinese have handle this.

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:18.411
And to Juliette's point,

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:20.947
the idea that this was manufactured

00:06:20.947 --> 00:06:24.050
and intentional, that this lab leak then

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.953
is the source of COVID 19

00:06:26.953 --> 00:06:27.754
and that this is what

00:06:27.754 --> 00:06:29.622
the origin theory is rooted in.

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:31.157
You can put that aside and you can say

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:33.025
perhaps it is accidental.

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.627
And then the amplification in point

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:36.295
where it was really that initial outbreak

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:37.096
was that market.

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:38.531
But when you look at the labs,

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:39.732
I think this is really important.

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:39.932
You have to

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.200
look at the circumstantial evidence

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.602
of where they're located.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:44.270
One of them is about a 30 minute drive,

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.805
the Wuhan Institute of Virology.

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.240
From that first amplification

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.307
point, the market,

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:50.476
the other just two blocks away.

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:51.277
And the other thing

00:06:51.277 --> 00:06:52.078
that is undeniable

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:54.914
that all of this is the early handling

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:56.015
or mishandling

00:06:56.015 --> 00:06:57.183
from the Chinese government.

00:06:57.183 --> 00:06:58.851
I mean, we covered this extensively.

00:06:58.851 --> 00:06:59.819
There was the silencing

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:00.620
of whistleblowers,

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.455
one of them being a doctor who

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:04.157
we spoke with a few days

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:06.426
before he ultimately died from COVID 19.

00:07:06.659 --> 00:07:08.261
And he was simply trying to warn friends

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.228
and family

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:10.563
that this was a strange

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:12.031
mystery illness going around

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:13.666
that got screenshot at it

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.535
and went very public

00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:16.669
and got him in a lot of trouble

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:17.670
with local police.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:18.805
So there was certainly

00:07:18.805 --> 00:07:20.473
from the local government in Wuhan

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:20.940
an effort

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.608
to stop the rumors,

00:07:22.608 --> 00:07:24.377
as they put it, from being spread

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:26.012
and to keep this quiet.

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:27.113
And that is ultimately

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:28.381
what folks are looking at here

00:07:28.381 --> 00:07:30.216
as the real culpability factor,

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:32.452
even beyond how this started, is

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:34.687
how it was mishandled and the cover up

00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:35.988
that followed.

00:07:35.988 --> 00:07:37.590
Yeah, I remember you covering that, Dr.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:37.857
David.

00:07:37.857 --> 00:07:39.292
I believe he was an ophthalmologist

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:40.293
or something at the time,

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:42.295
and it was just heartbreaking to see

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:43.830
what happened to him.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:44.130
Julie,

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.199
I think the overall concern here

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:47.099
is not necessarily

00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:48.734
just pointing the finger

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:50.069
at who's to blame here.

00:07:50.069 --> 00:07:51.270
We know that this virus

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.505
originated in China.

00:07:52.505 --> 00:07:54.674
We know that, unfortunately,

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:57.143
we will see future viruses and pandemics

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.411
to come.

00:07:58.411 --> 00:07:59.412
And the fact that China

00:07:59.412 --> 00:07:59.979
has not been

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.714
transparent in terms

00:08:01.714 --> 00:08:03.850
of allowing investigators

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.418
in, I think is a bigger concern.

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:07.954
That's exactly right.

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:09.255
And look,

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:10.823
you don't get time

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.158
back in the pandemic, so.

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:14.427
Exactly as we're all saying,

00:08:14.594 --> 00:08:16.362
whatever the genesis is,

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:17.864
there is a moment

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:19.365
when this can be contained

00:08:19.365 --> 00:08:21.133
and China knows that. Right.

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.802
And so their failure to act

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:24.403
we call it the squandered time, right?

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.706
The January, possibly December.

00:08:27.206 --> 00:08:29.509
The dates are still up in the air

00:08:29.742 --> 00:08:33.312
as of 2019 or January 20, 20

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:34.847
when they start to notice

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:36.782
a respiratori disease

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:37.984
that is spread

00:08:37.984 --> 00:08:40.186
very quickly and is killing.

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:41.721
They are not transparent about that.

00:08:41.721 --> 00:08:43.756
There's there's no politics about this.

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.958
They they call in the W.H.O.

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.193
they allege in early

00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:48.661
January of 2020

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:49.795
that they're concerned

00:08:49.795 --> 00:08:51.297
about this new outbreak

